# P028 S0 fixtures: the nested git repos under
# 01_s0/fixtures/s0/*/repo/.git are regenerated by the gate
# (01_s0/fixtures/s0/build_s0_fixtures.py) and must not be stored as gitlinks.
# NOTE: ignoring only ".../repo/.git" is NOT enough -- git 2.43 still treats
# any directory containing a .git dir as an embedded repo on `git add`
# (verified: 12 embedded-repo warnings with the .git-only pattern, and in a
# scratch repo). The whole repo/ dir is therefore ignored; the generator
# rebuilds its working-tree files deterministically, so nothing is lost.
# `git check-ignore` on each of the 12 .../repo/.git paths still matches
# this pattern (via the ignored parent dir).
01_s0/fixtures/s0/*/repo/
# P028 T011 windows corpus: same rule for fixtures/windows/*/repo/
# (rebuilt by fixtures/windows/build_windows_fixtures.py).
fixtures/windows/*/repo/

# P028 T008 demo fixtures: fixtures/demo/ and fixtures/demo-block/
# are themselves real git repositories (verify needs real Git state)
# and are rebuilt deterministically by fixtures/build_demo_fixtures.py
# (fixed commit dates, deterministic HEADs). Ignore the whole dirs
# for the same embedded-repo reason as the S0 corpus above.
fixtures/demo/
fixtures/demo-block/
